{"body_markdown":"","change_reason":"追加真实浮点材料阅读链路计时、默认预算失败和诊断边界，保留原委派及上下文减量历史。","content_hash":"870e291b19141c1239b3a5c67d740878a0b4fd156e918e8320359ea8868b0e08","created_at":"2026-09-16T06:39:16.610691Z","created_by":{"id":"codex-reading-delegation","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"workspace_summary","keywords":["reading-note","subagent","上下文预算","固定来源","handoff","subagent_requirements","能力偏好","reading-latency","默认预算失败"],"kind":"document_section","level":null,"owner_id":"PRJ-ARCHITECTURE-EVOLUTION","payload":{"blocks":[{"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"","relation":"references","revision":2,"sha256":"1df804130728e6619ebfb2c63920cb51e4875769265ad7b00fac3d7add52efe9","target_id":"MEM-1b419e02-3f69-5690-a1d5-1d5f0bdd588b","target_kind":"record"}],"markdown":"原reader-results与原能力偏好块为历史固定依据；latency-results追加本轮真实计时。\n\n真实浮点阅读默认10/30及限流2/2两次预算失败；最小1/1双语诊断在100k字符/32MiB预算内完成note→handoff→主侧接受，覆盖partial。完整可观察墙钟470.011秒，API内71.932秒；召回39.947秒中分路29.113秒、正文准备8.443秒、CE推理0.089秒。原read回执332692字符含327792图像data_url并触发工具截断，主侧note1901字符。独立profile显示handoff主要成本在来源复核；尚未实施性能优化。\n\n本轮保留默认预算下失败的实际路径，以及另行放宽预算的诊断路径；failed Run是失败与成本证据，不冒充成功完成。测量包含实际记录的工具、后端和调用间隔范围；调用间隔不直接等于模型推理，profile与正式计时分列。没有实施性能优化；不能据单次诊断推断普遍加速、费用降低或业务正确率。此前主上下文字符减少结果继续仅作为其原场景历史证据，不覆写旧数字。","type":"prose"},{"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"cfdba83777306e1e25f23da38cccfea95bfddfa04cf47c3911bf63779f3f6c50","target_id":"MEM-1b419e02-3f69-5690-a1d5-1d5f0bdd588b","target_kind":"record"}],"markdown":"以下原委派单元r1保留当时实现、低成本reader及全部验证限制；其中固定low选择是历史行为，现行模型选择由后续能力偏好更新说明限定。","type":"prose"},{"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"cfdba83777306e1e25f23da38cccfea95bfddfa04cf47c3911bf63779f3f6c50","target_id":"MEM-1b419e02-3f69-5690-a1d5-1d5f0bdd588b","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"039bf59d7e92f80067b2c299f0c696719ae418c7adce5b3213f5557bd57c648f","target_id":"MEM-afa98edf-0a9e-57cd-aba6-56d9c3681152","target_kind":"record"}],"markdown":"本章记录独立新增的阅读委派能力；统一设置的历史报告保留其当时验证范围，作为固定基线引用。","type":"prose"},{"block_ids":["reader-results","latency-results"],"ref":{"locator":"","relation":"references","revision":2,"sha256":"1df804130728e6619ebfb2c63920cb51e4875769265ad7b00fac3d7add52efe9","target_id":"MEM-1b419e02-3f69-5690-a1d5-1d5f0bdd588b","target_kind":"record"},"type":"unit"},{"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"","relation":"references","revision":2,"sha256":"e421bec016052de61a0a00987c55a1de43af44f4a5b96939ba0b258f0ddf115f","target_id":"MEM-472e4d18-f18d-5d13-84e3-28d3d5ae211a","target_kind":"record"}],"markdown":"新增 collaboration.subagent_requirements 自由文本模型/能力偏好；缺省优先低成本、较低能力可用模型和低推理深度，并须完成检索、完整阅读与结构化笔记。用户自定义文本原样保留，去除首尾空白后限1–2000字符；经policy及委派包交给宿主按实际可用模型选择。off始终优先，无宿主能力仍同RS回退；偏好不授予工具或材料权限，不扩大原RS预算。\n\n旧schema-1缺新字段仅内存补默认，原字节及revision不变；完整写入禁止遗漏字段丢失偏好。软件和本机合成升级验证不证明指定模型实际可用、业务阅读质量、总费用或端到端延迟改善；原阶段实际reader、字符对比、失败和覆盖缺口均保留为历史证据。","type":"prose"},{"block_ids":["requirements-results"],"ref":{"locator":"","relation":"references","revision":2,"sha256":"e421bec016052de61a0a00987c55a1de43af44f4a5b96939ba0b258f0ddf115f","target_id":"MEM-472e4d18-f18d-5d13-84e3-28d3d5ae211a","target_kind":"record"},"type":"unit"}],"missing_refs":[],"role":"methods","section_key":"reading-delegation-20260916","title":"子Agent阅读与主Agent交接","watch_refs":[]},"previous_revision":2,"provenance_gap":null,"record_hash":"d526670cbb8f2e4ec5b5cc6e23db19089184addd16199f7b58873be4da037d89","record_id":"MEM-50f66b7c-7953-5715-8b70-5ae7705176ab","record_reason":"保存子Agent阅读与有界笔记交接的实现、实际独立AI和软件验证边界。","revision":3,"schema_version":3,"sensitivity":"internal","sources":[{"locator":"","relation":"references","revision":2,"sha256":"e421bec016052de61a0a00987c55a1de43af44f4a5b96939ba0b258f0ddf115f","target_id":"MEM-472e4d18-f18d-5d13-84e3-28d3d5ae211a","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"","relation":"references","revision":2,"sha256":"1df804130728e6619ebfb2c63920cb51e4875769265ad7b00fac3d7add52efe9","target_id":"MEM-1b419e02-3f69-5690-a1d5-1d5f0